/*
 * Implements semantic validation for constructor calls in Ymir.
 *
 * Responsibilities:
 *   - Enforce class-construction rules(classes cannot be constructed on
 *     the stack unless wrapped in a copy expression).
 *   - Enforce deep-copy restrictions for class constructors.
 *   - Validate constructor arguments via PrototypeCallValidation.
 *   - Compute overload-resolution scoring contributions.
 *   - Construct a CtorCallValue representing the final constructor call.
 *
 * Constructor delegates(CtorDelegateValue) encapsulate:
 *   - the instance being constructed
 *   - the constructor prototype
 *
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::call::ctor
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/call/ctor.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-30
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
